y once you add content to your site. Read on and bookmark resources of interest.</li>\\012    <li><a href="https://www.drupal.org/docs/extending-drupal">Extend Drupal:</a> Drupal\\342\\200\\231s core software can be extended and customized in remarkable ways. Install additional functionality and change the look of your site using addons contributed by our community.</li>\\012  </ol>\\012  <h2>Next Steps</h2>\\012  <p>Bookmark these links to our active Drupal community groups and support resources.</p>\\012  <ul>\\012    <li><a href="https://www.drupal.org/community/events">Upcoming Events:</a> Learn and connect with others at conferences and events held around the world.</li>\\012    <li><a href="https://www.drupal.org/community">Community Page:</a> List of key Drupal community groups with their own content.</li>\\012    <li>Get support and chat with the Drupal community on <a href="https://www.drupal.org/slack">Slack</a> or <a href="https://www.drupal.org/drupalchat">DrupalChat</a>. When you\\342\\200\\231re looking for a solution to a problem, go to <a href="https://www.drupal.org/support">Drupal Support</a> or <a href="https://drupal.stackexchange.com/">Drupal Answers on Stack Exchange</a>.</li>\\012  </ul>\\012</div>\\012  \\012      \\012        \\012</div>\\012</div>\\012";}s:9:"#attached";a:3:{s:7:"library";a:2:{i:0;s:18:"views/views.module";i:1;s:18:"views/views.module";}s:14:"html_head_link";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{i:0;a:4:{s:3:"rel";s:9:"alternate";s:4:"type";s:19:"application/rss+xml";s:5:"title";s:0:"";s:4:"href";s:29:"http://localhost:8080/rss.xml";}}i:1;a:1:{i:0;a:4:{s:3:"rel";s:9:"alternate";s:4:"type";s:19:"application/rss+xml";s:5:"title";s:0:"";s:4:"href";s:29:"http://localhost:8080/rss.xml";}}}s:14:"drupalSettings";a:1:{s:10:"contextual";a:1:{s:5:"theme";s:7:"olivero";}}}s:6:"#cache";a:3:{s:8:"contexts";a:6:{i:0;s:28:"languages:language_interface";i:1;s:14:"url.query_args";i:2;s:21:"user.node_grants:view";i:3;s:16:"user.permissions";i:4;s:5:"theme";i:5;s:8: